  message: "Initial investigation: rabbitmq has 18K orphan Erlang functions (out of 46K total) — the Erlang analyzer extracts symbols but doesn't resolve function calls well. haproxy has 2.4K orphan C/C++ symbols — function pointers and macro-expanded calls aren't resolved. Both are analyzer-level gaps requiring improved call resolution in the Erlang and C/C++ analyzers. This is substantial work — keeping at P4."  # 6f05
